  "minimum_trusted_mathematical_scope": {
    "source_set": "C = {O + t V + d : t in the complete original closed t interval, d in the complete original D}. The serialized rational V, including nonzero Vz, is used exactly without renormalization.",
    "fixed_normal": [
      "1",
      "2",
      "0"
    ],
    "exact_support_formula_to_be_checked": "After exact n dot V = 0 is checked, n dot C lies between n dot O + min(n dot D) and n dot O + max(n dot D). The complete affine domain is independently checked with both t endpoints and all 8 D corners.",
    "hypothetical_expansion": "Only under the additional mathematical hypothesis |error_i| <= tau for each coordinate, the projected slab expands by tau * sum(abs(n_i)). Both t endpoints, all 8 D corners and all 8 error corners give 128 independent vertices.",
    "original_box_guard": "All 6 endpoints of the independently computed full 3D forward AABB must equal the original B before the proposed channel may be used. Original B constraints remain present. A false equality result remains an actual negative and forbids the channel.",
    "intersection_scope": "With the original-box guard true, B intersect expanded-slab conservatively contains bare C. The expanded slab alone contains the hypothetical tolerance tube. The unexpanded B intersect expanded-slab does not automatically contain that whole tube; the separate tube-in-B observation may be false.",
    "no_native_inference": "No assertion that actual native geometry lies in the hypothetical tau tube, no native primitive/trim membership, no whole-material native filling, no full 16-frame/continuous G2, and no physical qualification follows."
